      - STRICTLY AVOID these ingredients: cilantro.
      - All ingredient amounts must be numeric and use one of the following units: "lb", "oz", "cup", "tbsp", "tsp", "g", "kg", "ml", "l", "count", "clove", "slice", "pinch".
